Dear All,

I am following this thread and in some sense agree with Jonah.

BTW, regarding the question from Professor Gelman:

> So here's my question:  can I do this:
> dist100 <- dist/100 INSIDE "wells"
> in a reasonable way?

I think you can do:

stan_logit(y ~ I(dist / 100) + arsenic, data="wells")

Where I() stands for: https://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-devel/library/base/html/AsIs.html

Cheers,
FH

