If readers have problem with this, then they've got bigger
problems than learning Stan.

I was suggesting grouping variables together into objects
so they can be passed together and have internally consistent
naming access.  It's easier to think about chunks than all
these individual arguments, especially if the work's being
repeated all over the place.

- Bob

