Agreed, 'alpha[3]' might not be converging on zero, but rather a small negative value. It's also reasonable to expect correlation with the other parameters. The values I'm using as predictors are all non-negative, but the runs I've been posting here have been using unstandardised predictors. Here's output for a similar run post-standardisation:

