Hi,

mu in model block has 4m elements, but they are not stored.

log_lik in generated quantities has 4m x (number of samples drawn from the approximate posterior) elements. I guess filling this matrix and writing it to the file takes in the current Stan version quite a long time.

If 10*(N+K+N*K)<<N_obs then you don't probably need loo

You could use k-fold-CV with grouping by MPs or topics, and then you could use compute mean or sum log_lik for the group, which would then need less memory.

Aki

