Subject: Re: [stan-users] Manual page 204 log Uniform(s|1,T)
Message-ID: <C3Du2bWSwbc.k9AGawcTAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <C3Du2bWSwbc._4xFjGL1AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
