> >
> > My confusion is using the categorical distribution to generate samples from my gamma process.  Also, I'm not sure how to initialize r_[], since in Stan, we can't have int[] parameters.  In JAGS/OpenBUGS, I passed in the pmf and indices and used dcat to sample from r_[].  However, I'm having conceptual difficulties wrapping my head around the categorical distribution concept in Stan.  I understand why I'm getting the error message below, but not how to generate samples from the categorical distribution.  I simply want to generate integer samples using my pmf for each of the interval groups.  These integer samples (one from each interval group) are cumulatively summed to generate my theta(t) Gamma process samples.  Any help is appreciated!
> >
> > Regards, Reuben
> >
