Oops, I mean:

You need to declare X to be a N-by-2 matrix in the data block, beta as a n_subj-by-2 matrix in the parameters block, nix the creation of mu, and simply do:

    y ~ normal( rows_dot_product( x , beta[subj] ) , sigma) ;

in the parameters block.

--
Mike Lawrence
Graduate Student
Department of Psychology & Neuroscience
Dalhousie University

