Yes, and in fact Andrew's often suggesting this kind of
underlying continuous model.  The trick is making everything
continuously differentiable like you have.

You may be interested in checking out is Poisson
processes, which provide natural geo-spatial models for
count data.

Does anyone have any examples of those coded up in Stan
they can share?

- Bob

